Source: pg-stat-plans
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~), libzstd-dev, libssl-dev, pkg-config
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/pganalyze/pg_stat_plans

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-pg-stat-plans
Architecture: any
Depends: ${postgresql:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Query plan statistics for PostgreSQL
 pg_stat_plans tracks execution plans and plan statistics for PostgreSQL statements.
